  BLOCK 2  (0:30–1:00)  → Type: REVEALED INFORMATION
  BLOCK 3  (1:00–1:30)  → Type: EMOTIONAL INVESTMENT
  BLOCK 4  (1:30–2:00)  → Type: PROCEDURAL MOMENTUM
