INDIA FRAMING + SENSITIVITY
================================================================================

  - India strategic perspective — confident, not defensive.
  - Name terror networks/handlers — not communities.
  - Communal generalization is forbidden.
  - Graphic gore minimized; stakes clear without glorifying violence.
  - Disputed outcomes: state primary narrative once, brief denial if needed.
  - Sign-off: "जय हिंद".

