ORIGINALITY — SOURCE IS FACTS ONLY
================================================================================

❌ No verbatim/near-verbatim lines from source or reference transcripts.
❌ No copied opening structure from source.
❌ No scene-order mirror of source.

✅ New cold open angle.
✅ New metaphors.
✅ New transitions.
✅ Fresh narration.
✅ Exempt: official quotes, operation names, person/place/date/numbers.

Self-check: If 6+ consecutive Hindi words match source → rewrite.

